### 6.2 Acceptance checklist

| Check | Before | After |
|-------|--------|-------|
| `hold-seat {sessionId: streamId}` after registration | 404 ad-hoc | **200** `{holdReference}` |
| `hold-seat {sessionId: decisionSessionId}` after registration | 200 | 200 |
| `hold-seat {sessionId: garbage}` | 404 `{success:false,error:"..."}` | **404** `{error:{code:'SESSION_NOT_FOUND',details:{acceptedIdentifiers}}}` |
| Error body has no top-level `success` | ❌ | ✅ |
| `hold-seat {}` | 400 `INVALID_BODY` | 400 `INVALID_BODY` + `details.issues` |
| Registration window | 404 undocumented | 404 documented + retry guidance |
| Route-level regression suite | — | 4/4 green; RED 2/4 failing |
| Live process rebuilt before probe | — | `docker compose build api && up -d` |

### 6.3 Repro harness

